<title>USA: Broad National Bancorp to buyback shares.</title>
<headline>Broad National Bancorp to buyback shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEWARK, N.J. 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Broad National Bancorp said on Tuesday that its board has authorized the repurchase of up to $4 million of the company's common stock in the open market.</p>
<p>Management was given discretion about the timing and the number of shares to be repurchased, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>At April 30, 1997, the company had 4,584,688 common shares outstanding.</p>
